        ("h", "3. Rehearse on a copy – at least twice"),
        ("p", "Every import runs first on a test copy of Odoo with scheduled jobs and outgoing mail switched off, so nobody receives a test invoice. We describe how to set up such a copy in a separate article. The first rehearsal finds the mapping errors, the second measures how long the import takes – that time goes into the cut-over plan."),
        ("p", "After each rehearsal key users test their daily work on the copy: create an order, produce, deliver, invoice. Whatever they cannot do there, they will not be able to do on Monday."),
